    "scope": "Actual root existing b slot rollingb110 from2026-10-25T12:24:03.948Z to2026-10-25T12:26:57.589Z, interleaved with queue/policy observations, not continuous active viewing. Every exact native/nearest4 source, all4 unchanged full raw masters and entire white/cyan/alpha sheet actually viewed. Exact unchanged mascot reference766ae05fcdab3bd41f9f0967e64f387de3adafef0f29626570d5670d9b460976 actually viewed earlier same root turn and explicitly reused. Strict full actual prompt/ordered inputs/flag/dispatch/cache binding proof runtime/root-review-slot-b/rollingb110/verified-binding.json SHAc0b098b1fd507fff0695c3ace0c94d96da5eeaaf3c94446ed524808b357fbded. visible-alpha-v1, visible-source-differences-v1, hair-features-v1, collar-fit-v1. All4 raw alpha255..255; full matte views solid cloth/backing, no visible holes. Specific tiny unresolved details recorded, no approval from metrics.",
    "approved": {
      "2": "Brown-grey brushed-back short wavy hair, separate dark brows, large curled dark/grey handlebar moustache, smooth chin and actual single round monocle on screen right with hanging chain remain visible source features. One monocle is correctly retained, no invented second lens. Smooth yellow green-eyed noseless/earless mascot with one serious small mouth, dark brown high upturned trench collar/broad lapels and black inner crew-neck shirt preserve screen-left three-quarter view, crop/light/full dark-grey vignette. Short broad throat joins the black neckline naturally inside coat, without floating lapel, pinched collar, long exposed stalk or white bib. Individual chain links, moustache fibers and lapel stitching are unreadable source limits. Full unchanged raw and white/cyan/alpha views show solid255 clothes/backing and no hole/lost backdrop."
    },
    "rejected": {
      "1": "Source native/nearest4 shows distinct dark eyebrow groups beneath the cap brim; complete full raw has no separate eyebrows at all, leaving bare yellow forehead above both eyes. Restore actual visible brows under visor occlusion. Preserve white/light-grey crown navy cap, silver shield-and-upright/eagle-like device with gold wreath, gold braid/black visor, clean lip/chin/single serious mouth, navy broad-lapel coat/light grey shirt/dark tie, upward screen-left pose/crop/light/full cream-grey backing and natural short broad collar fit. Exact tiny silver badge relief is not readable, no invented precision demanded. Raw/mattes solid255 without holes; rejection is clearly missing visible brows.",
      "3": "Full raw retains a human-style projecting nose bridge/bulb above the moustache and fleshy human lips, rather than the reference smooth noseless mascot face and one simple mouth. Remove human nose/lip anatomy while preserving the serious source expression with one mascot mouth. Keep thick dark brown swept-up wavy hair, separate dark brows, source jaw stubble/moustache, forehead scar and diagonal screen-right cheek scar, dark brown broad-lapel trench/black inner shirt, pose/crop/light and full dark-grey vignette. Collar transition is already short/broad and solid. Individual stubble/scar stitch detail is unreadable, not a reason to invent new scars. Whole raw/white/cyan/alpha solid255; failure is visible human facial anatomy.",
      "4": "Source has separate dark brows clearly visible above the round spectacles, especially on screen right; the complete raw omits both brow groups and shows bare yellow skin between glasses and cap. Restore those source brows while preserving their actual cap overlap. Keep thin round pale-metal glasses, white-crown navy peaked cap/silver shield/eagle-like badge/gold wreath/braid/leaves, clean lip/chin and single slight smiling wedge mouth, dark navy broad-lapel coat/white shirt/dark tie, tilted screen-left pose/crop/light/full cream-grey backing and compact broad shirt-collar fit. Tiny silver/gold relief and fine lens interior are unreadable source limits; actual visible brow loss is clear. Full raw/mattes solid255, no transparency/backing failure."
    },
